<h1>unsorted list</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="list.html"><em>list</em></a> whose order of items, if any, is not known.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="sort.html"><em>sort</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
The list need not be out of order, simply that it is not known to be in order.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPR">PR</a></p>

<hr>

Go to the
<a href="https://www.nist.gov/dads/">Dictionary of Algorithms and Data
